.material-grid {
  display: grid;
  gap: 12px;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 8px;
}
@media (max-width: 420px) {
  .material-grid { gap: 8px; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
  .material-swatch { padding: 6px; }
} Use this before and after a visual change to confirm the layout actually moved. The studio's brand palette (moss green, warm sand, charcoal) should stay untouched unless asked.

